# Notifications

::summary
The Notifications hub destination in the shell wrapper: mark-all-read control, deep-linking rows with the unread attr (right-side blue dot; accent left border BANNED), the F-15 notification-preferences pane with toggle switches as form checkbox items, and the quiet-hours modal — referenced by name, no inline copy.
::

